near Wanatah, Indiana.

4
00:00:09,031 --> 00:00:10,762
It was an unusually warm day.

5
00:00:10,992 --> 00:00:13,264
Warnings went out, but many people never

6
00:00:13,274 --> 00:00:13,691
got them.

7
00:00:14,241 --> 00:00:16,121
The Weather Service says its South Bend

8
