18
00:00:34,791 --> 00:00:37,023
But that day, tornadoes killed more than

19
00:00:37,033 --> 00:00:39,224
130 people across Indiana.

20
00:00:39,874 --> 00:00:42,038
Afterward, the Weather Bureau changed the

21
